abstract: >-
  Reproducible simulation-only benchmark comparing unsupervised and semi-supervised
  anomaly detection methods on the LHC Olympics 2020 R&D dataset, including contamination,
  held-out topology, and background-mass-shaping studies.
keywords:
  - anomaly detection
  - particle physics
  - LHC Olympics
  - Deep SVDD
  - Deep SAD
